        <summary>Gets or sets whether the input event is handled.</summary>
        <value><see langword="true" /> if the listener consumes the input event; otherwise, <see langword="false" />.</value>
        <remarks>
          <para>The generated event adapter returns this value to the Android listener after the event handlers run. A value of <see langword="false" /> lets the view try its own unhandled-input callback.</para>
          <para>The constructor accepts an initial value. The generated adapter supplies <see langword="true" /> when it raises the event for a subscribed handler.</para>
